        "taskGoal": "Turn a dense engineering brief into a final implementation plan that stays architecture-first, milestone-aware, and contract-driven even after 100 artificial window handoffs. The final answer must still include architecture summary, module and contract map, phased implementation plan, verification matrix, risks and mitigations, and open questions.",
